  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: That rich woman from the "Paradise" place came by again. She offered me
      a job as her private chef.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "Bro, that\u2019s the dream! Why are you still standing here in the steam?"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: Nah, too much drama. I like it here. I can wear my flip-flops and talk
      trash with you. You don't get that in "Paradise."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: True. Silk shirts are overrated anyway.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: Right? Give me my old tank top any day.
